The images in this folder, and manifest.json's outlines, are adapted from
Z-Anatomy's atlas (https://www.z-anatomy.com, models by Lluís Vinent
Juanico and the Z-Anatomy project; https://github.com/LluisV/Z-Anatomy),
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International Licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes: the muscles grouped and coloured as LifeOS's twenty muscle
groups; sheets cut away; deep muscles hidden; eyes added; the arms
posed; rendered front and back by scripts/body-map/ (ADR-0060).

These adapted images are licensed under the same licence, CC BY-SA 4.0.
The rest of LifeOS is not affected.
